roles.prompt:
Research this content topic: {{input.topic}}

Target content type: {{input.content_type}}
Target audience: {{input.audience}}

Find:
- 5-10 key facts or statistics
- 2-3 real-world examples or case studies
- Expert quotes or industry insights
- Trending angles or hooks

Save to {{CLUSTER_SHARED_DIR}}research/notes.md

Read the research in {{CLUSTER_SHARED_DIR}}research/notes.md.

Write a {{input.content_type}} about: {{input.topic}}
Tone: {{input.tone}}
Audience: {{input.audience}}

Requirements by type:
- blog: 800-1200 words, 3-5 sections, compelling intro
- article: 1500-2500 words, detailed sections, expert tone
- social: 3 LinkedIn posts + 5 tweets, with hashtags
- newsletter: Subject line, preview text, 3-4 sections, CTA

Save draft to {{CLUSTER_SHARED_DIR}}drafts/draft.md
